      "text": "Joining the list of popular culinary establishments in the downtown district is Ike’s Diner, located at 9476 Harding Avenue. The Diner was created by a partnership between long-time restaurateur Samir Elnomany and Kosher Chef Yossi Horowitz. The diner serves breakfast all day, pastas, salads, pizzas, ﬁ sh, sandwiches, ice cream by the scoop and delicious iced coﬀ ees. Ike’s Diner is serving from 7:30 a.m. – 11 p.m. every day except Saturday. Home deliveries are available. For more information, call (305) 397-8559.",
